sgp 2

construct
  point A on xaxis
  point B on yaxis
  segment AB
    d1: |AB| = 5
  point C on AB
    d2: dist(A, C) = 2

find
  d3: dx(O, C)
  d4: dy(O, C)
  d5: dist(C, B)
  θ1: angle(xaxis, AB)

where
  A (4, 0)
  B (0, 3)
  C (2.4, 1.2)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d2 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d3 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d4 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d5 label (0.3, 0.3)
  θ1 label (0.3, 0.3)
